# The build context for docker/Dockerfile is the repository root. Only what a project install needs goes in:
# no history, environments, caches, local state, telemetry dumps, secrets or tests.
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mosfet
**/otel-*.jsonl
**/.env
**/secrets/
**/tests/
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
dist/
dist-native/
web/
benchmarks/
.claude/
.github/
